	- Confirmed registration code flow is implemented with prepare + confirm pages.
	- Confirmed selected pricing plan is preserved in frontend query/localStorage and redirects to subscription after login.
	- Confirmed payment cannot be fully applied after registration yet because Swagger marks POST /billing/checkout as a 501 placeholder and defines no plan parameter.
