[x] COMPLETED - Config files UX
	- Replaced direct config tiles with reusable modal-based config access UI.
	- VLESS card now opens a popup using the existing shared Modal component.
	- VLESS popup loads the subscription URL through a server action, generates a QR code with the existing qrcode package, supports one-click copy, and provides an open-link action.
	- OpenVPN card now opens a matching popup with saved/default profile download and region-code download.
	- Added /api/configs/openvpn/[region] proxy route for region-specific .ovpn downloads.
	- Added EN/RU translations for all config popup copy and accessibility labels.
	- Backend gap documented: Swagger still does not provide a full available OpenVPN region/server list endpoint, so the UI cannot truthfully show a complete server list yet.

